- Keep all text within the upper 75-85% of canvas (bottom ~250px is
  often obscured by mobile UI/caption).
- Slide 1 carries ~80% of the hook weight — bold headline (5-8 words),
  curiosity gap. Slide 2 must independently hook too. One idea per
  slide. Consistent visual system across all 5 slides.
- Last slide = single clear CTA badge/pill (e.g. "Read full guide ↓")

## Caption structure

- Hook line (mirrors slide 1) + literal arrow (↓) + "Read full guide"
