  and manually type it.
- FAQ-style: a direct question in real search language, then a short
  direct answer
- Main long-tail keyword + one supporting query, each repeated
  naturally 3-4 times across the caption
- No hashtags, ever
- Target length: 300-500 chars normal day, up to 800 if genuinely
  needed (front-load the hook — first ~125 chars show before "...more")
- Do not add a separate "link in bio" line — the article link already
  appears directly in the caption body per the rule above. A second,
  vaguer CTA at the end is redundant and should not be included.

